  "id": "feldenkrais-method",
  "term": "Feldenkrais method",
  "definition": "The Feldenkrais method is a movement-based approach in which people are guided through conscious movements to increase awareness of the body, breathing, and self. It has been used to support balance, coordination, pain management, and mood.",
